@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Mengajukan Pemesanan Layanan

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    BoxBorderColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
    DividerBorderColor #999999
    DividerFontColor #111111
}

actor "Klien" as Klien
boundary "Katalog Layanan" as Katalog
boundary "Detail Paket" as Detail
boundary "Form Pemesanan" as Form
control "BookingController" as BookingController
control "BookingAvailability" as BookingAvailability
entity "Bookings Model" as Booking
entity "StudioLocations Model" as StudioLocation
entity "StudioRooms Model" as StudioRoom
entity "Projects Model" as Project

Klien -> Katalog : Membuka halaman layanan
Katalog -> BookingController : request daftar layanan
BookingController -> Booking : ambil kategori dan paket aktif
Booking --> BookingController : data kategori dan paket
BookingController --> Katalog : tampilkan daftar layanan
Katalog --> Klien : Menampilkan kategori dan paket layanan

Klien -> Katalog : Memilih kategori dan paket
Katalog -> Detail : buka detail paket
Detail -> BookingController : request detail paket
BookingController -> Booking : ambil detail paket
Booking --> BookingController : data paket
BookingController --> Detail : tampilkan detail paket
Detail --> Klien : Menampilkan detail paket

Klien -> Detail : Membuka formulir pemesanan
Detail -> Form : tampilkan form pemesanan
Form -> BookingController : request data form
BookingController -> StudioLocation : ambil cabang aktif\nberdasarkan location_code
StudioLocation --> BookingController : data cabang
BookingController -> StudioRoom : ambil ruangan aktif\nberdasarkan room_code
StudioRoom --> BookingController : data ruangan
BookingController --> Form : tampilkan form pemesanan
Form --> Klien : Form pemesanan ditampilkan

Klien -> Form : Memilih cabang, ruangan, tanggal, dan add-on
Form -> BookingController : cek ketersediaan slot
BookingController -> Booking : ambil data paket terpilih
Booking --> BookingController : data paket
BookingController -> BookingAvailability : hitung slot tersedia
BookingAvailability -> StudioRoom : ambil ruangan aktif\nberdasarkan room_code
StudioRoom --> BookingAvailability : data ruangan
BookingAvailability -> Booking : ambil booking aktif\npada location_code dan room_code
Booking --> BookingAvailability : data booking

BookingAvailability -> BookingAvailability : validasi tanggal maksimal 1 bulan
BookingAvailability -> BookingAvailability : abaikan slot hari-H yang sudah lewat
BookingAvailability -> BookingAvailability : hitung durasi paket + add-on waktu
BookingAvailability -> BookingAvailability : tambah jeda antar sesi 15 menit
BookingAvailability -> BookingAvailability : validasi jam operasional dan bentrok slot

BookingAvailability --> BookingController : daftar slot tersedia
BookingController --> Form : tampilkan slot tersedia
Form --> Klien : Menampilkan jadwal tersedia

Klien -> Form : Mengisi data pemesanan
Klien -> Form : Klik simpan dan kirim pemesanan
Form -> BookingController : store(data pemesanan)
BookingController -> BookingController : validasi data pemesanan
BookingController -> Booking : ambil paket terpilih
Booking --> BookingController : data paket
BookingController -> BookingAvailability : validasi ulang slot pemesanan
BookingAvailability -> Booking : cek bentrok booking\nberdasarkan location_code dan room_code
Booking --> BookingAvailability : hasil pengecekan booking
BookingAvailability --> BookingController : hasil validasi slot

alt Data valid dan slot tersedia
    BookingController -> BookingController : hitung total biaya pemesanan
    BookingController -> Booking : create booking
    Booking -> Booking : simpan package_id, client_id,\nlocation_code, room_code, tanggal,\nwaktu, dan status pengajuan
    Booking --> BookingController : booking tersimpan
    BookingController -> Project : create project draft
    Project -> Project : simpan project status DRAFT
    Project --> BookingController : project tersimpan
    BookingController --> Form : redirect detail/status pemesanan
    Form --> Klien : Menampilkan status menunggu konfirmasi admin
else Data tidak lengkap atau tidak valid
    BookingController --> Form : tampilkan pesan kesalahan
    Form --> Klien : Pemesanan belum tersimpan
else Tanggal tidak valid
    BookingController --> Form : tampilkan pesan tanggal tidak valid
    Form --> Klien : Tanggal lewat atau lebih dari 1 bulan ditolak
else Slot tidak tersedia
    BookingController --> Form : tampilkan pilihan waktu lain
    Form --> Klien : Pemesanan ditolak karena slot tidak tersedia
end

@enduml
